253
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:06,600
My Otismon is feeding upon the night.

254
00:14:07,520 --> 00:14:11,060
He said no one may enter
until he returns at dawn.

255
00:14:11,320 --> 00:14:12,496
Ah, forget about it.

256
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:15,179
As a matter of fact, Thunderbolt...

257
00:14:18,480 --> 00:14:20,480
I can't remember a thing.

258
00:14:20,620 --> 00:14:21,597
What were we talking about?

259
00:14:21,680 --> 00:14:23,437
We'll be leaving you of guard duty.

260
00:14:23,520 --> 00:14:25,057
Go home and get some sleep.

261
00:14:25,140 --> 00:14:27,560
Oh, yeah, that's right. See ya. Hold it.

262
00:14:27,920 --> 00:14:29,337
Don't forget to leave us the key.

263
00:14:29,420 --> 00:14:32,000
Huh? Oh, the key. Here. Thank you.

264
00:14:32,540 --> 00:14:33,740
What a nice guy.

265
00:14:34,380 --> 00:14:35,210
Let's go.

266
00:14:46,620 --> 00:14:47,900
Hurry up, Wizardmon.

267
00:14:48,120 --> 00:14:50,177
Let's find the crest and
cruise on out of here.

268
00:14:50,260 --> 00:14:51,877
This place gives me the creeps.

269
00:14:51,960 --> 00:14:52,790
Relax.

270
00:14:52,873 --> 00:14:55,037
We've got plenty of time
before the sun comes up.

271
00:14:55,120 --> 00:14:57,355
My oldest man won't be back for hours.

272
00:14:58,900 --> 00:15:00,782
Maybe he keeps it in the coffin.

273
00:15:03,380 --> 00:15:04,840
Got it. Great.

274
00:15:04,980 --> 00:15:06,537
Now let's just get out of here.

275
00:15:06,620 --> 00:15:07,450
Huh?

276
00:15:08,540 --> 00:15:09,370
Uh-oh.

277
00:15:09,680 --> 00:15:11,197
What are you doing in here?

278
00:15:11,280 --> 00:15:12,110
Nothing.

279
00:15:12,240 --> 00:15:15,037
If you're looking for something,
maybe I can assist you.

280
00:15:15,120 --> 00:15:15,950
Another copy.

281
00:15:16,033 --> 00:15:20,432
Do you think I'd just leave the original
lying around for thieves like you?

282
00:15:23,980 --> 00:15:25,820
Wizard Man! I'm all right.

283
00:15:26,300 --> 00:15:27,140
Those eyes.

284
00:15:27,520 --> 00:15:29,797
From the first time you
looked at me with those eyes,

285
00:15:29,880 --> 00:15:33,617
I knew you'd turn against me, and that's
why I had to teach you by punishing you.

286
00:15:33,700 --> 00:15:36,357
I would have hurt you even more
when you became a good servant,

287
00:15:36,440 --> 00:15:39,940
but I promise you I will not
be so easy on you this time.

288
00:15:40,260 --> 00:15:43,537
And do you think your betrayal
will go unpunished, Wizard Man?

289
00:15:43,620 --> 00:15:48,140
How could I betray you when I was
never on your side to begin with?

290
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:49,720
You little fool!

291
00:15:52,920 --> 00:15:53,980
Grizzly wing!

292
00:16:11,280 --> 00:16:13,320
We really have to stay together.

293
00:16:14,840 --> 00:16:17,480
Those who play together lose together.

294
00:16:17,740 --> 00:16:18,622
I'm not afraid.

295
00:16:18,920 --> 00:16:21,626
You soon will be, you
pathetic little traitor.

296
00:16:23,660 --> 00:16:24,520
Magical game!

297
00:16:34,780 --> 00:16:36,380
Look there, up in the sky.

298
00:16:36,660 --> 00:16:38,657
Wizardmon and Gatomon are in a fight.

299
00:16:38,740 --> 00:16:39,570
Oh, no.

300
00:16:39,653 --> 00:16:41,305
I hope they're not being hurt.

301
00:16:42,080 --> 00:16:43,440
Whoa, let's go.

302
00:16:44,320 --> 00:16:45,200
Wait up!

303
00:16:45,400 --> 00:16:46,400
I want to go too!

304
00:16:46,800 --> 00:16:48,417
I can't risk you getting hurt.

305
00:16:48,500 --> 00:16:49,330
Wait here.

306
00:16:58,260 --> 00:17:03,142
Well, I hope you realize there's no safe
place to hide during this lightning storm.

307
00:17:07,960 --> 00:17:08,840
Magical game!

308
00:17:22,300 --> 00:17:26,737
There are those eyes again, and this time,
not only are they filled with rebellion,

309
00:17:26,820 --> 00:17:28,857
but I can also see a glimmer of hope.

310
00:17:28,940 --> 00:17:31,297
The hope that one day your
dreams will come true.

311
00:17:31,380 --> 00:17:32,210
That's right.

312
00:17:32,293 --> 00:17:35,157
I believe in my dreams, and
that's how I've made it this far.

313
00:17:35,240 --> 00:17:36,997
And just what have you really achieved?

314
00:17:37,080 --> 00:17:38,837
You believe in your worthless friends,

315
00:17:38,920 --> 00:17:41,557
and you believe that your
dreams can come true.

316
00:17:41,640 --> 00:17:43,699
Dreams do not exist for the stupid.

317
00:17:43,940 --> 00:17:46,457
If you believe in yourself,
then dreams are real.

318
00:17:46,540 --> 00:17:49,937
And to make my dreams come true,
I only have to do one thing.

319
00:17:50,020 --> 00:17:51,400
Defeat you! What?

320
00:17:51,660 --> 00:17:56,900
My dream is for me to return to my true
identity, the one I had before I met you.

321
00:17:57,080 --> 00:17:58,757
What do you mean, true identity?

322
00:17:58,840 --> 00:17:59,958
Could it be that...

323
00:18:00,400 --> 00:18:01,988
Are you the eighth Digimon?

324
00:18:03,960 --> 00:18:05,480
This changes everything.

325
00:18:06,560 --> 00:18:07,820
Before I crush you,

326
00:18:07,940 --> 00:18:11,057
I'll give you the pleasure of watching
me destroy your wizard friend.

327
00:18:11,140 --> 00:18:13,180
Fizzly Weed!

328
00:18:18,080 --> 00:18:19,480
Hang on!

329
00:18:22,920 --> 00:18:24,680
No, not that!

330
00:18:26,520 --> 00:18:27,900
Oh, no!

331
00:18:29,380 --> 00:18:30,800
My friend!

332
00:18:32,020 --> 00:18:34,380
We've come to help you, Gatomon!

333
00:18:35,240 --> 00:18:36,070
Hey!

334
00:18:36,660 --> 00:18:38,260
Quick, get out of the way!

335
00:18:38,540 --> 00:18:39,640
Nova Black!

336
00:18:44,040 --> 00:18:48,660
When will you Digidestined
ever learn Crimson Lightning?

337
00:18:54,660 --> 00:18:56,720
Greymon Digivolve!

338
00:19:08,280 --> 00:19:10,440
Greymon Digivolve!

339
00:19:21,100 --> 00:19:24,020
Go get him, Metal Greymon!

340
00:19:28,060 --> 00:19:30,580
Go get him, Metal Greymon!

341
00:19:30,820 --> 00:19:32,140
Mega Claw!

342
00:19:36,700 --> 00:19:38,420
Giga Blaster!

343
00:19:46,520 --> 00:19:48,200
You impudent fool!

344
00:19:48,400 --> 00:19:52,737
Did you really think you could beat me
with those pathetic little toys of yours?

345
00:19:52,820 --> 00:19:54,040
Oh, come on!

346
00:19:59,220 --> 00:20:00,480
Nice try, buddy!

347
00:20:00,860 --> 00:20:03,919
If the Digidestined are
coming to defend Gatomon...

348
00:20:04,060 --> 00:20:08,337
Hey, what they think is no business of
yours, go blow smoke somewhere else!

349
00:20:08,420 --> 00:20:10,257
you will pay for your impudence

350
00:20:10,340 --> 00:20:16,377
just what do you mean I hope you like

351
00:20:16,460 --> 00:20:20,017
fishing Gatomon because you're
going to be the perfect bait to lure

352
00:20:20,100 --> 00:20:23,817
out the 8th digi destined child now
I don't need the crest to find that

353
00:20:23,900 --> 00:20:29,720
cowardly puny human that's not fair
my Otismon I don't play fair stop

354
00:20:30,580 --> 00:20:31,410
Gatomon

355
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:35,080
Tai help me

356
00:20:39,520 --> 00:20:42,340
Oh, I wonder what's taking them so long.

357
00:20:42,980 --> 00:20:44,660
Come back, Gatomon.

358
00:20:45,680 --> 00:20:49,880
Will Tai rescue Gatomon
before Myotismon finds Kari?

359
00:20:50,380 --> 00:20:53,180
Tune in to the next
Digimon Digital Monsters.

360
00:23:03,460 --> 00:23:05,754
The secret of the Digimon Adventure You
